>>
endobj
584 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A final area worth highlighting is vulnerability management. Several startups have focused on using AI to better organize or enrich existing data. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
585 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Two good examples are Phoenix Security and Opus Security \(acquired by Orca Security\). Phoenix uses AI to map CWEs to vulnerabilities, improving prioritization logic. Opus applied AI to power advanced workflows for data correlation and vulnerability remediation. A newer entrant worth mentioning is Maze, which takes an end-to-end AI approach to vulnerability analysis. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
