734 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A final category worth mentioning is the way vulnerability management is evolving with AI. Opus Security \(Acquired by Orca\) has long supported remediation workflows, but now augments almost all of them with AI to assist with prioritization, triage, and automation. On the other hand, Maze is taking a radically different approach, where AI handles every step of the vulnerability investigation and remediation process, from discovery to prioritization to response.)
/Pg 34 0 R
>>
endobj
