751 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Another factor to consider is the pace of innovation from major platforms like OpenAI and Anthropic. These tools are rapidly adding features, including basic security guardrails, which, while not as robust as those from dedicated providers, indicate a growing focus on security at the model level.)
/Pg 36 0 R
>>
endobj
752 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (So, when should you buy a dedicated AI security solution? The answer: if you're moving quickly on AI adoption and handling sensitive data, dedicated tools can offer the visibility and control your security team needs to stay ahead of emerging risks.)
/Pg 36 0 R
>>
